Subject: Take Quarkus 3.33.2.1 on the 1.18 line

StackGres 1.18.10 subclasses fabric8 Container and calls the 7.4.0 all-args constructor. Quarkus 3.33.2.1 manages fabric8 7.5.2, which inserts restartPolicyRules between restartPolicy and securityContext, so CustomContainer has to match that constructor.

Origin: backport, https://github.com/ongres/stackgres/commit/66cd4f2a51b12022ca97d05d100227b388d5cdf9, https://github.com/ongres/stackgres/commit/7f24680fc6b0027e400e5ca389b8c9136a373628
CVE: CVE-2026-39852
CVE: CVE-2026-50559
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/ongres/stackgres.git de07225fa07fb0e583168acfe3b41f92f0277f80
Adaptation: Keeps StackGres 1.18.10 and sets quarkus.version to 3.33.2.1, the first platform release whose quarkus-vertx-http contains both fixes, instead of 66cd4f2a51's 3.34.6. Takes only CustomContainer.java from 66cd4f2a51, the same file 1.18.10 has, plus the ContainerRestartRule BuildableReference added in 7f24680fc6. Leaves that commit's sundrio 0.300.0 bump and the other CRD @Buildable edits out.
Verify: cmd `dhi def build package/main/stackgres-operator/debian-13/1.18.yaml` expect "BUILD SUCCESS"
Drop-When: upstream >= 1.19.0 (only the 1.18 leaves apply it)

